docs {
  The main flow, chained through variables (`threadId`, `proposalId`, `interruptId`,
  `toolCallId`, `actionId`): investigate PLN-1001, propose the February make-good, ask to
  apply, check that nothing is written while the card is pending, approve, roll back and
  reload. The numbers are the detector ground truth (Base, `docs/design.md`).
}
